{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "d337f6b6bf505ebe6092d7292ae8e0412b2b7b11e80936a3e149975f90d4e107", "ja": "Pleaseベストショット！", "zh": "Please最佳镜头！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ea521335255bb68a2751478e76b3804cf07ed4e835b8083855356ae9f3e5f950", "ja": "ユニット活動が始まり、ステージを盛り上げ\nる方法を模索するメンバー達。そんな一同を\n撮り続ける亜利沙。特典撮影は順調だが、演\n出案は難航中……と、通りすがりの可奈が、\n簡単な楽器の演奏を発案するのだった。", "zh": "组合活动开始后，成员们开始摸索让舞台热闹起来的方法。\n一直拍摄着大家的亚利沙。特典拍摄进展顺利，\n但演出方案却陷入僵局……这时，路过的可奈\n提出了演奏简单乐器的主意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "99be2525b18375efff7dfb3fe332ad223a3dea24145e5b5dbbbcb54afca05ce7", "ja": "（野外イベントに向けて、ユニットの活動が始まった。\nレッスンは今の所、順調に進んでいる。あとは……）", "zh": "（面向户外活动，组合开始了活动。\n目前为止，课程进展得很顺利。接下来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "b9f321967597abd8b717b6a758cee56afef3f4497d354c9cc494f6742664869c", "ja": "ステージを盛り上げる方法って、何がいいんだろねぇ。\nなかなか思いつかないべさ……。", "zh": "要怎么让舞台热闹起来才好呢？\n还真是不太想得出来啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "1e76f1bef1d9072c404c1892b0d6d08fd83ef0e9b14f1679adad7a6e283d8a2e", "ja": "あんまりない難しくないことでって、\n{$P$}さんも言ってたけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也说过，\n不用搞得太难，只要简简单单就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "372abf89ceff564d3600d7f10a851c24517cd10d87eca0b0f8b397174e351efe", "ja": "ガーデニングで育てた野菜を配るのも考えたけども、\nちょっと違うみたいだしねぇ……。", "zh": "我也考虑过把园艺种出来的蔬菜分给大家，可总觉得好像有点不太一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "d23ad99cd677ab49fde4d8fb6f5315fe52c1f6ab7b0e0eeaade244658513b4bb", "ja": "私も、どうにかして会場のお客さんたちに料理を\n振る舞えないか、方法を考えてるんだけど……。", "zh": "我也在想办法，看看能不能为会场的客人们做点料理……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "d7fc5c5a3ecbb7d71a63ad437d552a26bb3cc42769b6c92ce31cfdca15070cc1", "ja": "うーん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "d7fc5c5a3ecbb7d71a63ad437d552a26bb3cc42769b6c92ce31cfdca15070cc1", "ja": "うーん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "ed46e4c70e2eea43140137e4fd0380823cfb51e768f746933b0cf4560f5f25a4", "ja": "ダメだ……。アイディアって、\n出ない時は全然出ないものだね……。", "zh": "不行啊……灵感这种东西，\n想不出来的时候，是真的一点都想不出来呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "fc5f836795a527e139a90f3a36f08fd1056a9ef196893b2194e9787a8e00a165", "ja": "だねぇ。したっけ、ひとまず、\n自分でやれる事をがんばらねば！", "zh": "是呢。那样的话，总之，先努力做好自己能做的事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "98465dba34a67b7e436b03fe9f580189bc392feaf4703c8ef42e5c1fe2d71bb8", "ja": "うん……そうだね。\nまずは、レッスンをがんばらないとだよね！", "zh": "嗯……是啊。\n首先得努力练习才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "87bb5893ee02c4adbd817c757144e22256f6b6e2b16fab0a4f8f5caff2c34730", "ja": "シャッターチャーンス！", "zh": "快抓拍——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "18fd0486e80845721a6a0dd5543ef2f1606e87feea4944921c8e0d095fa0cb40", "ja": "ひゃあっ！？", "zh": "呀啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "5f951c0620b701e6a874b3713c803e46c0397ed8481523ec77e5b403017d84da", "ja": "わわっ！？　亜利沙ちゃん！？", "zh": "哇哇！？亚利沙！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "3f2ba4a683009eb5f8b76b7c0a918446b6f7af02a56995e91c5f4e4cffc7a689", "ja": "うんうん……ふたりには、やっぱり笑顔が一番です♪\n最高のツーショット、いただいちゃいました！", "zh": "嗯嗯……果然还是笑容最适合你们两位了♪\n亚利沙拍到最棒的双人照啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "dea4ce21b490119bcc58e19f3194911fd2e4527d1f9ac3b08ee805433e70add9", "ja": "あ、亜利沙ちゃん、さっきまで端っこでストレッチ\nしてたよね……？　今、一瞬でこっちに……。", "zh": "啊，亚利沙刚才不是还在角落里做拉伸吗……？怎么现在一瞬间就到这边来了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "8cbfef6aa11352b8898d3b1458ac1c186e24ade2dc0d723b5a82da26116939d7", "ja": "ありさは特典撮影を任された身……アイドルちゃんの\n輝きを、一瞬たりとも見逃すわけにはいきません！", "zh": "作为负责拍摄特典的工作人员……偶像们的光辉，一瞬间都不能错过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "c327f01d30b89ee06672f7f73ead6481d083446740b021a8d060d3d759781d15", "ja": "亜利沙さん、いつも以上にすごい熱意だねぇ……。", "zh": "亜利沙，比平时还要有干劲呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1017_p", "source_sha256": "17870896d5ba9f51c36f0c5a92730a35ac256a9a41f679201643d2c3fe7d14f9", "ja": "みんな、お待たせ。レッスンの調子は……\nあれ、もしかして例の特典撮影中だったかな？", "zh": "大家久等了。练习的状态……\n咦，难道你们正在拍那个特典吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "f508401927902e5bcb19fd0aba86b16a89503a9c0cd192a6880d18fd622f957e", "ja": "はい！　ばっちり笑顔を押さえました！\nデジカメの容量が、秒でいっぱいになっちゃいます♪", "zh": "是！完美捕捉到大家的笑容了！\n数码相机的容量一下子就要满啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7538f2948accd67be3c1e9e6434d3e3fd6ce19fc96f0f6077a2f789bcf6dfc89", "ja": "亜利沙は言わずもがなと言ったところか……。\n美奈子とひなたは、どんな感じだ？", "zh": "亚利沙自然不用说了……\n美奈子和日向怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "6e9f149d102de9636f0a48cb09abf5cf4d288004e0983c0471d9faec9b6b593f", "ja": "問題はないんですけど、練習風景を撮られるのって、\nけっこう恥ずかしいなって……あはは。", "zh": "没什么问题，就是被拍练习时的样子，\n感觉还挺不好意思的……啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "eb10a7572bbe7f6aef1b1995a713220429ef2d4c551118cddf7b78ce44a045c6", "ja": "私、この間レッスンウェアと間違えてうちの店の\nロゴTシャツ着てレッスンしちゃって……。", "zh": "我前阵子把家里店里的logo T恤错当成练习服穿去上课了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "0aeedb36595dce63e45dc8ab3f6457520621b166f4acefca77707343dfa49b3c", "ja": "はい！　しっかりお姉さんの珍しいうっかりシーン、\nバッチリ撮影させてもらいました！", "zh": "是！姐姐难得犯迷糊的场面，我可是清清楚楚地拍下来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "92600eb6351f1bdf8c537b14c54be1252fc5f85bad3e2ed258b5e7eb853f3b9f", "ja": "あたしは、くま三郎のプリンを食べてるところを\n撮られてちゃってねぇ……。", "zh": "我啊，被拍到正在吃熊三郎的布丁了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "59983b8970e44dd176bf2fe20490cb52604e669a41cdfca12eb46486cabdf871", "ja": "くま三郎？", "zh": "熊三郎？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "066626fb94ca8a37db7540def52f4ab3606e899a315117e3c1214a7b11d58dbb", "ja": "うん。くま三郎はね、『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』と\nおんなしテレビ局で、算数を教えてるんだよぉ。", "zh": "嗯。熊三郎呢，在和《☆哔哔行星☆》\n同一家电视台教算术哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "5dee074d29df86455a4ee796bef153b8ce2f1d27fcf3a8adb7038f8c06977345", "ja": "も、もしかして、おかしいかなぁ……？　あたしもう\n中学生なのに、小学生向けの番組見てるなんて……。", "zh": "难、难道很奇怪吗……？我都已经是中学生了，却还在看面向小学生的节目……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "e045bdabdb19c03790f419434c84cd9f8ec8ca2224f843f4500b1543afd2af5f", "ja": "好きならいいじゃないですか！　それに、\nプリンを頬張るひなたちゃん……かわいかったです♪", "zh": "喜欢不就好了嘛！而且，\n大口吃布丁的日向……超可爱的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1028_035hin", "source_sha256": "ca20506613838341d78980dd495cc1be20be74d8d91aa8a9711b0a2809f63a62", "ja": "うう、恥ずかしかったべさ……せっかくの特典が\nあたしのおやつ姿なんて、そんなんでいいのかね……？", "zh": "呜呜，太让人不好意思了呀……难得的特典居然是\n我吃点心的样子，这样真的好吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1029_019min", "source_sha256": "90855192c840c96cf2fe1472a4540005319de20785f6bc04a9a3b4ff92f07d91", "ja": "私のうっかりも、特典映像としてアリなのかな……。", "zh": "我的冒失表现，作为特典映像也没问题吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "9e88464e15594927dbfc95b8b2faee05e58886fdc6dd383be1206232c14a22da", "ja": "もちろんです！　どっちも需要があります！\nありさにも、ファンのみなさんにも！", "zh": "当然可以！两种都很有需求！\n无论是亚利沙，还是各位粉丝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "8111f6a953a72ea92fac9301c2b7fd71b14669fe5383156fad31e5054255e43c", "ja": "何故なら、ファンが普段見ているのは、\nステージの上で輝いているアイドルちゃん……。", "zh": "因为，粉丝们平时看到的，都是在舞台上闪耀的偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "70c615cfdb1fed07e83acc535c103cc7d66fa92172246bb52eabe7b876ca5fc5", "ja": "そんなアイドルちゃん達も、日常では普通の女の子！\nそのギャップが、たまらないんです！", "zh": "那些偶像们在日常生活中也是普通的女孩子！\n这种反差实在让人欲罢不能！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1033_p", "source_sha256": "6debf416056c8cd1e9382155bc49a33d10905bbe10537c0618199e4eac6961b8", "ja": "本来、亜利沙も観察する側でなく、\nアイドルとして観察される側なんだけどな……。", "zh": "说起来，亚利沙本来不是观察别人的一方，而是作为偶像被观察的一方才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1034_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1035_009rit", "source_sha256": "887740210993bd6f66505f6765121034cd59fd9ee2d06bc870ef2fc838f4c46d", "ja": "お疲れさまです、\n{$P$}。", "zh": "辛苦你了，\n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1036_036kan", "source_sha256": "8c1ff47c6c2286b3d41724dc07ecd8c7ddee125243686c4ecd41ca2465d4f8fa", "ja": "お疲れさまでーす♪", "zh": "辛苦你了──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1037_019min", "source_sha256": "2897cbc2c29a3e97d8c99add8c5529dbcc469fd28dab1437c266e52a9f2e3208", "ja": "あっ、律子さんに、可奈ちゃん！", "zh": "啊，律子小姐，还有可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1038_035hin", "source_sha256": "58461442eb129dc472f9897be9e7fdc3302a6a08fd0a01599a37c93c771f00cb", "ja": "可奈ちゃん、お疲れさまだよぉ。\n今日は、お仕事じゃなかったのかい？", "zh": "可奈，辛苦啦。今天不是去工作了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1039_p", "source_sha256": "835748c0603be658308cca035aea30d18fb97b083d75793cbfacd91e4d7a1be4", "ja": "ふたりは今日、雑誌の取材だったな。\nお疲れさま！　どうだった？", "zh": "你们两个今天是去接受杂志采访吧。\n辛苦了！感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1040_036kan", "source_sha256": "ece94ded67a90d91b295153d1daef40be30f9a6ae7c5f7fab9e3f9700aa9d031", "ja": "バッチリでした！　わからないところは、\n律子さんにフォローしてもらって……えへへ。", "zh": "非常顺利！有不明白的地方，律子小姐还帮我解了围……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1041_009rit", "source_sha256": "861baa6b51de3e296711f90674fca93e550e4b8a758ddc1757fc65853d2c3e1f", "ja": "取材の方は大丈夫です。それより、可奈に例の件を\n話したら、なかなかいいアイディアをくれたんですよ。", "zh": "采访那边没问题。比起这个，我把那件事告诉可奈后，她给了我一个相当不错的主意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1042_p", "source_sha256": "4e51b32c19fbeec1be39b57eb7a5325d71fcbcb05dc93c89fa3daec4d1e7881c", "ja": "例の件……あ、公演を盛り上げる方法の事か？\nそれはぜひ、聞かせて欲しいな。", "zh": "那件事……啊，是指让公演热闹起来的方法吗？  \n那可一定要跟我说说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1043_036kan", "source_sha256": "89791ac02483814eb3d903594ff9d8aca80cad7077b653d80bd89f2f3bba81ab", "ja": "はい！　あの、みんなで\n楽器を演奏してみるっていうのは、どうですか！？", "zh": "好的！那个，大家一起试着演奏乐器，怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1044_036kan", "source_sha256": "5da480efa6a14b35973a1eacd90cac5eda22d47452f0ce2c9d48fd0a34edfe3a", "ja": "『吹奏楽にチャレンジ！』とかは大変ですけど、\n簡単な楽器なら、今から練習すれば間に合いますよ！", "zh": "像『挑战管乐！』之类的虽然很辛苦，\n但简单的乐器现在开始练习的话，还来得及哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1045_p", "source_sha256": "a4db5d5114100c2e7434cdea30072f4db46a65667390c25f07142b85edaa2fde", "ja": "簡単な楽器……というと、\nカスタネットとか太鼓とか？", "zh": "说到简单的乐器……是响板之类的，还是太鼓之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1046_036kan", "source_sha256": "bb0a55d23b074fa3f8c47f378b28b9cfe8f26dcdba75969cbdcbd8dfe471145e", "ja": "そうです！　みんなでリズムを取って楽しめば、\nライブも盛り上がりそうかなって♪", "zh": "没错！大家一起打着节拍享受其中的话，演唱会的气氛也会热烈起来吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1047_035hin", "source_sha256": "2f4edfa5ac1dc256f92f3e4bfce7185a878f7ae572475dc2089661cd5ca0ceed", "ja": "そういう簡単な楽器で良ければ\nあたしでもできそうだねぇ。", "zh": "如果是那种简单的乐器，我好像也能做到呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1048_019min", "source_sha256": "f3694df93a3180422deb3dd7981d2d6098f890bf480f9c1f22756c9ab8649a82", "ja": "なるほど～。さすが可奈ちゃん♪", "zh": "原来如此～不愧是可奈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1049_036kan", "source_sha256": "a0ecf5736dbd2c5dd3deee2dff447c0f7fee7a739d9fa661909bc7243e7a498a", "ja": "えへっ♪　それに、楽器なら、\n私でも教えてあげられることがあるかもです！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 而且要说到乐器的话，说不定也有我能教你的东西呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1050_028ari", "source_sha256": "2154cb3c2d1363fe7845a65c8159a27c2ab16e69889bf48104255d975dcc0dc7", "ja": "楽器の練習に打ち込むアイドルちゃん達……。\n特典映像にも、ぴったりだと思います♪", "zh": "专心练习乐器的偶像们……我觉得也很适合作为特典影像呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1051_009rit", "source_sha256": "da809ad43b953538e36350ac38f983b360eac3402dc4e66b18e8dfe48e87b0bf", "ja": "みんなの負担にもならないし、楽器の音で注目も\n集められると思うんです。どうですか？", "zh": "这样既不会给大家增加负担，还能通过乐器声吸引注意力。我觉得应该可行。您觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1052_p", "source_sha256": "be37b41ec0ec367bf8623915ade4c65027b5ef3e58a1feddfad1b6bf575d7a99", "ja": "なるほど。簡単な楽器、いいアイディアじゃないか。\nありがとう、可奈！", "zh": "原来如此。简单的乐器，这主意不错嘛。\n谢谢你，可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1053_036kan", "source_sha256": "22fd14a2737c01bc41a0718ac63850b6215bf22997514d462c2b87b6160ede8c", "ja": "楽器が得意な可奈～♪　お手柄かな～♪\nお役に立てたみたいで、よかったです！", "zh": "擅长乐器的可奈～♪　可真是立了大功～♪\n能帮上忙，真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0129_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0129_story_03_1054_p", "source_sha256": "6ce79f45e7e1fddb4da9b909695c40d5d5afeb5f7609182a5c27d72215c5370c", "ja": "（イベントを盛り上げるアイディアは決まった……\n問題は、どんな楽器にするかだな！）", "zh": "（让活动热闹起来的点子已经决定了……问题是，要用什么乐器呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
